<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.7.10">
<l>mūṉṟeḻut tataṉai mūṉṟeḻut tataṉāl mūṉṟeḻut tākkimūṉ ṟeḻuttai</l>
<l>yēṉṟukoṇ ṭiruppārk kirakkanaṉ kuṭaiya vempuru ṭō ttama ṉirukkai</l>
<l>mūṉṟaṭi nimirttu mūṉṟiṉil tōṉṟi mūṉṟiṉil mūṉṟuru vāṉāṉ</l>
<l>kāṉtaṭam poḻilcūḻ kaṅkaiyiṉ karaimēl kaṇṭameṉ ṉuṅkaṭi nakarē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>The seat of our Puruṣottama,</l>
<l>having the goodness of grace for</l>
<l>those who accept the three letters</l>
<l rend="indent">– the three letters having created</l>
<l rend="indent">the three letters with the three letters –</l>
<l>is the protected city called Kaṇṭam on the banks of the Ganges,</l>
<l rend="indent">surrounded by huge forested groves,</l>
<l>of him who took three steps, appeared in the three,</l>
<l rend="indent">[and] took the form of the three in the three.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
